<title>BELGIUM: DE MAERTELAERE OPENS OFFICE IN SINT-NIKLAAS.</title>
<headline>DE MAERTELAERE OPENS OFFICE IN SINT-NIKLAAS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian investment bank De Maertelaere NV said on Wednesday it would open an office in the town of Sint-Niklaas.</p>
<p>It will be the ninth office for Ghent-based De Maertelaere, which is 50 percent family-owned.</p>
<p>Formerly a brokerage, it became a bank in May.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
